Hi,

It may be possible. The key issue is not with Canopy but with the fact that it might be hard to call somatic point mutations and CNAs without a normal control. These are used as input for Canopy and they are non-trivial. See the links below for more info on this.

https://github.com/yuchaojiang/Canopy/blob/master/instruction/SNA_CNA_input.md

https://github.com/yuchaojiang/Canopy/blob/master/instruction/SNA_CNA_choice.md

Yuchao

